-- PlanStep — one step of a plan: id, amount, optional currency, the
-- providers it routes through, and the entitlement grants it confers.
--
-- Static rows: none. The pre-flip inline-TS `defineSystemEntity` is GONE.
--
-- FM-retire-E1 Step 6 — LABEL-LESS entity; the bare `@codeName "PlanStep"`
-- trips the loader's identity-facet gate (see ButtonPayload.fenel). No
-- `Maybe ({})` field here, so no paren caveat. `grants: List PlanGrant`
-- name-refs the sibling PlanGrant entity (lazy catalog resolve).

@entity
@codeName "PlanStep"
PlanStep = PlanStep id: NonEmptyStr amount: NonNegInt currency: Maybe String providers: List String grants: List PlanGrant
